// The weather now, somewhere: Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com), free and without a key. Its geocoder
// finds the place, and its forecast says the conditions now. Asked each time, never kept.
// Written by scripts/pack.mjs from sources/weather (edit those, not this).
Requires(Core(), Basic(), Code())

Concept(OpenMeteo(), IsA(Source()), IsA(LearningSource()))

Concept(WeatherNow(), IsA(Result()))
